oes this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #111293\r\n- Closes #115984 \r\n- Supersedes #117311\r\n\r\nUntil the Tree control will have resizable columns I think approximately calculating the width of the text is better than having it cropped and hidden. I also added a couple of pixels to the initial width of the tree so that Physic Frame Time won't get on top the timing text.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1217\" height=\"371\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_pA78o4WKyl\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c76f8a2-1147-4065-b41e-1bd883a38abb\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1220\" height=\"410\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_zZNJfsNoy5\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0465d426-4ed6-43c2-a774-d032efc9192f\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1210\" height=\"365\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_PMQtMBkSFG\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a737c21-a019-4cae-bb30-8b0a2ca446b2\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1217\" height=\"370\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_XRXWwG9w8c\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb2130b6-39ca-40da-84a6-c4dabf34d59d\" />\r\n\r\nIt's a bit hacky because for some reason you need add the margin between columns and the cell margin to the minimum size of the column. I think it's a Tree problem I describe here #123703.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo AI.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","descri